# viz/ web app — local artifacts
node_modules/
dist/
*.local
.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
.eslintcache

# Ingested data is generated from easy_download by `npm run ingest`.
# We DO commit the currently-ingested `harreman` dataset (id chosen at ingest time) so the
# app works after a fresh clone without needing the source CSVs. Other/larger datasets stay
# local — add a matching `!public/data/<id>/` line if you decide to commit another.
public/data/*
!public/data/harreman/
!public/data/manifest.json

# TypeScript incremental build caches (should not be tracked)
*.tsbuildinfo
